rted accreditation. No legal opinion, intellectual-property review, or contractual assessment is being performed.  Regulatory: Check supplied campaign rules, required disclosure, and educational purpose. These fictional campaign rules are not a complete regulatory standard. Do not determine FDA, EMA, or other regulatory compliance.  All content remains a draft for qualified human review.';

